  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_EfeitoDeDemandaInduzida
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Efeito de Demanda Induzida
  _titleEn: Induced Demand Effect
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Alargar ruas para acabar com o congestionamento atrai mais carros, e
    em poucos anos o tr\xE2nsito volta ao mesmo n\xEDvel."
  _summaryEn: Widening roads to end congestion attracts more cars, and within a few
    years traffic returns to the same level.
  _realWorld: "Duranton e Turner mostraram em 2011, com dados de cidades americanas,
    que a quilometragem rodada cresce quase na mesma propor\xE7\xE3o das vias constru\xEDdas."
  _realWorldEn: Duranton and Turner showed in 2011, using data from US cities, that
    vehicle kilometers traveled grow almost in proportion to the roads built.
  _tradeOffs: "Transporte coletivo, cobran\xE7a pelo uso da via e bairros mistos
    reduzem a necessidade de viagens de carro."
  _tradeOffsEn: Public transport, road pricing and mixed neighborhoods reduce the
    need for car trips.
  _sources:
  - Label: Duranton e Turner (2011), American Economic Review
    Url: https://doi.org/10.1257/aer.101.6.2616
  - Label: Induced demand (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Induced_demand
  _relatedEntries:
